# Line-ending policy. The repository stores text as LF; Windows working trees may
# hold CRLF and git normalizes on the way in. Without this file, core.autocrlf=false
# makes every CRLF working-tree file read as a whole-file rewrite.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch files are executed by cmd.exe and must keep CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary assets: never normalized, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.pfx binary
